<odoo>
    <template id="report_offer_letter">

        <!-- Custom Styles to Match PDF -->
        <style>
            .offer-body {
                font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
                font-size: 12pt;
                line-height: 1.8;
                text-align: justify;
                color: #000000;
            }
            .offer-title {
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 24pt;
                font-weight: bold;
                color: #1f4e79; /* Corporate Blue */
                letter-spacing: 1px;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
            .offer-meta {
                font-size: 12pt;
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }
            .doc-id {
                text-align: right;
                font-size: 11pt;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
            .company-highlight {
                font-weight: bold;
                color: #1f4e79;
            }
            .signature {
                margin-top: 40px;
            }
            .legal-text {
                font-size: 10pt;
                color: #444444;
            }
        </style>

        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">

                <!-- Set Company -->
                <t t-set="company" t-value="o.company_id or res_company"/>

                <!-- ===================== PAGE 1 ===================== -->
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page offer-body">

                        <!-- Title -->
                        <div class="offer-title">
                            OFFER LETTER
                        </div>

                        <!-- Offer Release Date -->
                        <p class="offer-meta">
                            <strong>Offer Release Date:</strong>
                            <t t-esc="o.create_date.strftime('%b %d, %Y') if o.create_date else ''"/>
                        </p>

                        <!-- Candidate Details -->
                        <p class="offer-meta">
                            <t t-esc="o.partner_name"/><br/>
                            <t t-esc="o.partner_id.city if o.partner_id else ''"/>
                        </p>

                        <!-- Document ID -->
                        <p class="doc-id">
                            <strong>Document ID - </strong>
                            <t t-esc="o.id"/>
                        </p>

                        <!-- Greeting -->
                        <p>
                            Dear <strong><t t-esc="o.partner_name"/></strong>,
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 1 -->
                        <p>
                            Congratulations! With reference to your application and subsequent interview with us for a
                            career in our organization, we are pleased to inform you that you have been selected for
                            employment in <span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span>.
                            (Herein referred as “<span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span>” or “Company”) we are pleased to inform you that you have been selected for
                            employment in our organization as
                            <strong><t t-esc="o.job_id.name"/></strong>.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 2 -->
                        <p>
                            In the coming year, keep aspiring for change and be known for your thoughts and your work;
                            be the catalyst that this fast-changing world needs; keep sharpening your skills and
                            investing in yourself; and last but not the least – keep your work and life in perfect
                            balance, because that is the prerequisite for success.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 3 -->
                        <p>
                            We take this opportunity to thank &amp; appreciate your decision to join
                            <span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span>.
                            You are requested to join us on or before
                            <strong>
                                <t t-esc="o.joining_date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') if o.joining_date else ''"/>
                            </strong>.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 4 -->
                        <p>
                            You will be on probation for a period of 6 months from the date of your joining.
                            Your compensation would be as outlined in a separate document (Annexure I) “Salary Structure”.
                            The general terms and conditions governing your employment are outlined in Annexure III.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </t>

                <!-- ===================== PAGE 2 ===================== -->
                <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
                    <div class="page offer-body">

                        <!-- Paragraph 5 -->
                        <p>
                            You would be required to furnish digital copies of the documents and other listed
                            information in Annexure IV, before your joining date. Please note that the submission of
                            all the documents is mandatory to facilitate joining, background verification / validation
                            and appointment process at
                            <span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span>.
                            Annexure II provides details on the various compensation components and selected benefits
                            that we offer you as a part of the
                            <span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span> family.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 6 -->
                        <p>
                            This offer will be valid subject to successful clearance of your pre-employment background
                            verification check conducted by
                            <span class="company-highlight">
                                <t t-esc="company.name"/>
                            </span>.
                            Your written consent and requisite copies of documents is necessary to complete the
                            pre-employment check. You are requested to complete the submission of requisite documents
                            for pre-employment background check within two business days from the date of acceptance of
                            our offer of employment.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Your cooperation is solicited in this regard to enable us complete the necessary
                            pre-employment check on time and enable you on-board us.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 7 -->
                        <p>
                            Any change in the date of joining needs to be communicated to the concerned recruiter at
                            least one week in advance.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Paragraph 8 -->
                        <p>
                            Looking ahead, we see exciting times – we look up to you to provide impetus in accomplishing
                            our mutual endeavor of being the best in the business of IT Services. Welcome to our
                            Organization! We look forward to a mutually fruitful association.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Signature -->
                        <div class="signature">
                            <p>
                                <strong>For <t t-esc="company.name"/></strong>,
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Legal Note -->
                        <p class="legal-text">
                            This is system generated Letter/Contract. Agreeing to the Offer and its terms and
                            conditions in the workflow is as good as signing of physical contract/letter on mutual
                            agreement between us. It has all legal binding as per the law, if mutual trust is breached
                            at any point of time.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </t>

            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>